   },
   "2": {
    "original": "In addition, its status as an important non-natural site has never been established either.",
    "rewrite": "Furthermore, its significance as a crucial non-natural site has also never been confirmed."
   }
  },
  "final_span": "the Ro\u0219ia Montan\u0103 project, to the extent of intensifying the disputes caused by the project. Romania's ineffectiveness in securing protection for this region, highlighted by Ro\u0219ia Montan\u0103 and the adjacent mountains, clearly shows in its bid for official protection, as Ro\u0219ia Montan\u0103 is not recognized as part of the safeguarded cultural heritage. Furthermore, its significance as a crucial non-natural site has also never been confirmed. ICSID anticipates that Gabriel Resources can justify its claims on the basis of complaints about Romania\u2019s violation of articles 2 and 3 of both the UK BIT and the Canadian BIT.\nCEO also noted that Romania is sensitive to these options in merit three time more annual public spending what has been the Romanian public expenditure with ICSID versus the public expenditure on hospitalizations or the cost of incarcerations,",
